.TH "Docv::BlockKind" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::BlockKind \- What a block holds.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBenum Docv::BlockKind\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
What a block holds.
.SH "ENUM MEMBERS"
.TP 4
\fBText = 0_u8\fR
Inline text: filled (wrapped) or unfilled (one line).
.TP 4
\fBHeading = 1_u8\fR
A heading of \fB\%Block#level\fR: 1 for a section (\fB\%.SH\fR, \fB\%.Sh\fR, \fB\%#\fR), 2
for a subsection (\fB\%.SS\fR, \fB\%.Ss\fR, \fB\%##\fR), down to 6.
.TP 4
\fBBlank = 2_u8\fR
Vertical space of \fB\%Block#lines\fR empty lines.
.TP 4
\fBTable = 3_u8\fR
A table, in \fB\%Block#table\fR.
.TP 4
\fBRule = 4_u8\fR
A horizontal rule across the width.
.SH "DEFINED IN"
src/docv/ast.cr
